# Osteomancer Adept (CR 611.2a, 118.8): the permission lasts all turn and is not used up by one cast, and each cast owes a forage of its own. Turn 1 Bot1
# casts Gilded Goose (a Food), the Adept and a Lightning Bolt, and Faithless Looting discards Grizzly Bears and Memnite: the graveyard holds Black Lotus,
